  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Essential Package of Health and nutrition services (SHINE) in the region of Gedo, State of Jubaland, Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Essential Package of Health and nutrition services (SHINE) in the region of Gedo, State of Jubaland, Somalia</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The funding will enable a full continuity of the service delivery in 20 health facilities and maintain the gains made through the CHANGE project of system strengthening. The extension of the programme in Gedo is based on the following guiding principles developed by FCDO:
 
 &#x2022; Make the greatest contribution to health outcomes possible with funds available.
 
 &#x2022; Focus on highest impact services/supplies and delivery levels</narrative>
  </description>
